      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Waste not, want not. There is a pressing need to maximize the use of precious metals in catalysts to attain affordable and sustainable products. Recent progress in nanochemistry suggests that it is feasible to put the majority of metal atoms in a catalytic particle to work at optimal activity and selectivity."},
